  hand_authored_declarations: [
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "WORKSPACE_ENTRY", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "EmittedCrateWorkspaceHeld", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "refusal", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "write_files", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "git_head", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "run_emitted_crate_workspace", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "EmittedWorkspace", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "realize", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run.emitted_crate_workspace_host", decl_name: "write_emitted_workspace", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.target_invocation_host", decl_name: "run_emitted_crate_workspace", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1_compiler.target_invocation_host", decl_name: "emitted_crate_workspace_source_roots", field: WholeDeclaration }
  ],
  reason: "The partitioned Cargo workspace every emitted-Rust route writes, and the Pkg7e instrument //gunbc/instruments:emitted-crate-workspace (gunbc#12214) that discriminates it. write_emitted_workspace is the one writer the probe crate route (emitted_closure_compile_host write_probe_crate), the fixture route, the v2-native lane and gunbc compile --target rust call. Every workspace decision is modeled and called COMPILED: v1.compiler.emitted_workspace emitted_workspace_realization places every emitted file and returns the workspace's complete file population, composing gunbc.emitted_crate_workspace emitted_workspace_build (the layout, from the emission alone) with v1.compiler.stage0_crates partition_crate_boundary_emit_outcome_over (manifests and crate roots, with the emission's own registry dependencies). Calling it compiled rather than interpreted is the operator ruling of 2026-10-08 on gunbc#13597: the planner and its v2 closure are stage0 mirrors, which is the seed's first v1-to-v2 import, admitted because laying out an emission must read no source tree (an interpreted planner made gunbc compile depend on the caller's working directory holding gunbc's own sources, and cost a corpus index per emission). It replaces the single-package probe_manifest adapter, which is deleted. What stays in host Rust is the effect boundary: the in-process seed emission of v2.compiler.compile, file writes, git rev-parse for the receipt head, and two cargo runs through the existing emitted_closure_compile_host. Admitted by purpose under gunbc.v1_maintenance_standing v1_seed_standing: it is the build that proves the emitted v2 compiler partitions into crates. The instrument is run by author invocation, not a required phase; the plan's refusals are gated separately through test.claim.emitted_crate_workspace_witness. Classified against the refused classes: no language behavior, no compatibility obligation, no escape hatch (every arm refuses typed), no seed feature (the seed compiles what it compiled), and public surface limited to the cli_run re-exports of the runner, its receipt struct, and write_emitted_workspace with its EmittedWorkspace result, which the gunbc binary's compile output writer calls across the library boundary.",
  owning_dissolution_lane: "v1-hand-queue-drain" as RoadmapNodeId,
  trigger: "Delete this host module when host-effect emission lets the instrument be a .dag fold end to end: the emission, the workspace writes and the two cargo runs are emitted realizations of modeled effects (the capability gunbc.source_root_eval_driver_seed_growth names for its own shim -- the rendered main becoming one call into the fold), sufficient for the plan's rows to reach the renderer and the build as values inside one evaluated program, so no hand effect sequencing remains. Preserve the green build, the attributed dropped-dependency RED and the typed plan refusals at that replacement boundary.",
  current_boundary: "Host only: emitted_crate_workspace_host.rs (wired by mod in cli_run.rs, pub uses of run_emitted_crate_workspace, EmittedCrateWorkspaceHeld, write_emitted_workspace and EmittedWorkspace) and one registry row plus dispatch arm in target_invocation_host.rs. The host writes the files the compiled realization returns and runs cargo; it decodes no interpreter values. It calls existing seed producers (compile_entry_emission, lane_emit_compile_probe_root, probe_cargo_invocation, run_cargo) and adds none. No generated mirror is hand-edited."
}
